{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Daemon JSON-RPC surface (:3847). Single source of truth for the RPC chain: Flutter DaemonClient -> core rpc.rs -> hub. Bootstrapped from the live dispatch in core/src/daemon/rpc.rs — the wire is frozen; every name, alias, param and hub route here must match observed behavior. kind=passthrough methods are mechanical hub forwards (generated end-to-end); kind=core methods have hand-written daemon logic (sealing, local state, validation, notifications); kind=stub methods error by design. Generated artifacts: see codegen/generate.ts.",
  "methods": [
    {
      "name": "health",
      "kind": "core",
      "params": [],
      "notes": "Local liveness; reports mutande-core version."
    },
